title: Backwards sentence
golf: 48

Write `reverse_words(sentence)` that returns the words in reverse order, as a string.
`reverse_words("one two three")` gives `"three two one"`.
=== starter
def reverse_words(sentence):
    ...
=== broken
def reverse_words(sentence):
    return sentence.split()[::-1]
=== test
from harness import eq


def test_reverse_words(sol):
    eq(sol.reverse_words("one two three"), "three two one", 'reverse_words("one two three")')
    eq(sol.reverse_words("hi"), "hi", 'reverse_words("hi")')
